  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialMessages:
  - Greetings Young Godling!  Use WASD to move around the forest, and space to jump.
  - Ishana,You Must Protect The Forrest! Defeat the Decay and SAVE the Forest Realm!
  - Those are Slimemaw! Use Left Mouse to fire a SPIRIT shot at them!
  - Your bullet will land where the light shows
  - You can charge your magic to inflict more damage. Hold left click and release
    after the Aura has fully grown.
  - You can also switch to your ICE spirit enemy's to defeat those more viseral Enemies
    (USING THE SCROLL WHEEL!)
  - That is a sacred tree! They will heal you if you are low on health.
  - You can also switch to your ICE spirit enemy's to defeat those more viseral Enemies
    (USING THE SCROLL WHEEL!)
  - You can also switch to your ICE spirit enemy's to defeat those more viseral Enemies
    (USING THE SCROLL WHEEL!)
